OL,3,GNEWSADetective kept child abuse case
OL,4,Aevidence at home
OL,5,
OL,6,FCox, who resigned on 16 September, was
OL,7,Ffound to have committed gross
OL,8,Fmisconduct following a probe by the
OL,9,FIndependent Office for Police Conduct
OL,10,F(IOPC) at a hearing on Monday.
